despair, I was able to
produce a working copy of xcdroast (http://www.xcdroast.org).

With permission from the author, I am providing the binary version that =
I built available
for download.  Here is info about the binary package:

1) It will only work on the TRU64 5.1B OS.  I tried it on 4.0F, and it =
fails miserably.
