	*) miscellaneous glib/gtk libs to satisfy lib dependencies.

3) You have to unpack the package in /usr/local.  The application =
searches for all of the
shared libraries in /usr/local/lib.

4) This binary package is provided as-is.  If you find bugs, or a =
problem with the software, please address them to Thomas Niederreiter =
(tn@xcdroast.org) author of xcdroast, and current
maintainer.

